      "updated": 1773033439112,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "分析问题喜欢凭借直觉，而不是数学概率",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "分析问题喜欢凭借直觉，而不是数学概率",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "n2wW8b3VPVTw6N7VokdCC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 434.6016802592537,
      "y": 504.79364736545335,
      "width": 762.1399536132812,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1949459243,
      "version": 155,
      "versionNonce": 774961637,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774534958076,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "简单的规则 在堆量之后会形成 奇妙的图案 或者 复杂的行为(比如: 自然界的奇妙景观)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "简单的规则 在堆量之后会形成 奇妙的图案 或者 复杂的行为(比如: 自然界的奇妙景观)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "F2Wrq4bLr0HQEFUcEdXEF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 437.6521783739456,
      "y": 554.4232784079337,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
